### Legacy no-noise configuration: `icarus_pmtsimulationalg_2018_nonoise`
###
###
icarus_pmtsimulationalg_2018_nonoise: {
  @table::icarus_pmtsimulationalg_2018
  @table::icarus_pmtsimulation.disable_noise
} # icarus_pmtsimulationalg_2018_nonoise


